"automatically restart RTSS silently in the background."
msgstr ""
"RivaTuner Statistics Server (RTSS) crosses swords with Special K now an' then.\n"
"Try closin' it down if Special K don't behave as expected, or enable\n"
"the option 'Use Microsoft Detours API hooking' in the settings o' RTSS.\n"
"\n"
"If ye use MSI Afterburner, close it as well, or else it'll quietly\n"
"hoist RTSS again in the background."

